('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-5-day-fly-in-amboseli-safari-diani-beach-124668-46566549319','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-amboseli-elephants-1024x415.jpg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46566549319&a=2893129&m=124668","5-Day Fly-In Amboseli Safari & Diani Beach","46566549319","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-amboseli-elephants-1024x415.jpg","Bush and beach in five days, with short flights instead of long drives. Fly from Nairobi to Amboseli for two nights of game drives beneath Kilimanjaro, then fly to the white sands of Diani on the Indian Ocean. A good choice if you''re short on time but want both a proper safari and a few days to relax. Your safari at a glance Amboseli National Park (2 nights)","Safaris & Tours","2607.6","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F10%2Fkenya-amboseli-elephants-1024x415.jpg&feedId=851&k=22f99dd7481d2b962804d00320a4e5e6f05d31fd","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/5-day-fly-in-amboseli-safari-diani-beach/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
