('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-day-amboseli-tsavo-diani-beach-holiday-124668-46566549323','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-tsavo-1024x683.jpg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46566549323&a=2893129&m=124668","7-Day Amboseli, Tsavo & Diani Beach Holiday","46566549323","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-tsavo-1024x683.jpg","Safari all the way to the sea by road. Start with two nights in Amboseli under Kilimanjaro, cross Tsavo West to Tsavo East, famous for its red-dusted elephants, then continue to Diani for three nights on the beach. No internal flights needed: your driver-guide takes you from Nairobi right through to the coast. Your safari at a glance Amboseli National Park (","Safaris & Tours","2763.6","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F10%2Fkenya-tsavo-1024x683.jpg&feedId=851&k=2b83220037b6ba59cd7287e9922b580304867078","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-day-amboseli-tsavo-diani-beach-holiday/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
