('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-day-great-migration-safari-mara-river-crossing-124668-45461031919','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031919&a=2893129&m=124668","7-Day Great Migration Safari, Mara River Crossing","45461031919","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg","Witness the drama of the Great Migration at the Mara River on this 7-day Tanzania safari. You spend two days in the northern Serengeti, where hundreds of thousands of wildebeest and zebra brave crocodile-filled waters during their annual journey. River crossings typically take place between July and October, the best time to book this safari. Your safari at ","Safaris & Tours","2632.8","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg&feedId=851&k=2f458280d2d27506c50736e21213a49b75aa3864","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-day-the-great-migration-tour-at-mara-river-crossing/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-day-maasai-mara-lake-nakuru-diani-beach-124668-46566549324','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-nakuru-1-1024x683.jpg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46566549324&a=2893129&m=124668","7-Day Maasai Mara, Lake Nakuru & Diani Beach","46566549324","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-nakuru-1-1024x683.jpg","A classic Kenya combination: two nights in the Maasai Mara, a night at Lake Nakuru for rhino and flamingos, then a flight to Diani for three nights on the beach. You travel by private 4x4 with a pop-up roof for the safari section, with a scheduled flight from Nairobi to the coast. Your safari at a glance Maasai Mara National Reserve (2 nights): big cats, pla","Safaris & Tours","2994","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F10%2Fkenya-nakuru-1-1024x683.jpg&feedId=851&k=cba48455e2040f7b6245107509096e895dfea7df","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-day-maasai-mara-lake-nakuru-diani-beach/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-day-tanzania-nature-cultural-safari-124668-45461031920','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031920&a=2893129&m=124668","7-Day Tanzania Nature & Cultural Safari","45461031920","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg","This 7-day safari combines northern Tanzania''s most famous wildlife parks with a genuine cultural encounter, giving you a fuller picture of the country, its animals and its people. Alongside game drives in Tarangire, Lake Manyara, the Serengeti and Ngorongoro Crater, you visit a Maasai village to see traditional bomas and learn about the daily life and custo","Safaris & Tours","2342.4","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg&feedId=851&k=2f458280d2d27506c50736e21213a49b75aa3864","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-day-tanzania-nature-and-cultural-safari/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-days-6-nights-zanzibar-package-124668-45461031906','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-11874485-1-1024x683.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031906&a=2893129&m=124668","7 Days 6 Nights Zanzibar Package","45461031906","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-11874485-1-1024x683.jpeg","Seven days is the ideal amount of time to experience the best of Zanzibar without rushing: turquoise sandbanks, centuries-old Stone Town, rare wildlife and the island''s famous sunsets, with time left over just to relax on the beach. This package takes care of everything in advance, including your hotel, airport transfers and every tour, so you simply arrive ","Safaris & Tours","1279.95","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-11874485-1-1024x683.jpeg&feedId=851&k=b81c3221b36aa9f1248514bb0dfe538c5601c414","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-days-6-nights-package/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-days-hike-umbwe-route-124668-45461031913','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031913&a=2893129&m=124668","7 Days Hike Umbwe Route","45461031913","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg","The Umbwe Route is the steepest and most direct way up Mount Kilimanjaro. It climbs sharply through dense rainforest and along narrow ridges before joining the southern circuit near Barranco Camp, offering raw, dramatic scenery and far fewer climbers than the popular routes. Because it gains altitude quickly, Umbwe is best suited to experienced trekkers who ","Safaris & Tours","2318.4","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg&feedId=851&k=0dcaeb514f1ed3a2ecc4f499bedf07b32682d54a","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-days-hike-umbwe-route/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-7-days-marangu-route-hike-124668-45461031915','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031915&a=2893129&m=124668","7 Days Marangu Route Hike","45461031915","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg","The Marangu Route, often called the \"Coca-Cola Route,\" is the classic way up Mount Kilimanjaro. It is the only route where you sleep in mountain huts instead of tents, making it a popular choice for first-time climbers and anyone who wants a little more comfort on the mountain. Over seven days you climb through five climate zones: tropical rainforest where c","Safaris & Tours","1958.4","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg&feedId=851&k=0dcaeb514f1ed3a2ecc4f499bedf07b32682d54a","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-days-marangu-route-hike/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-8-day-great-migration-safari-mara-river-crossing-124668-45461031917','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031917&a=2893129&m=124668","8-Day Great Migration Safari, Mara River Crossing","45461031917","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg","This 8-day safari is built around one of the greatest wildlife spectacles on earth: the Great Migration crossing the Mara River. With two days in the northern Serengeti, you have the best possible chance of witnessing huge herds of wildebeest and zebra plunging through the river past waiting crocodiles. The Mara River crossings typically take place between J","Safaris & Tours","2767.2","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-33498304-1024x640.jpeg&feedId=851&k=2f458280d2d27506c50736e21213a49b75aa3864","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/8-days-great-migration-tour-mara-river-crossing/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-8-days-7-nights-zanzibar-package-124668-45461031905','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-11874485-1-1024x683.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031905&a=2893129&m=124668","8 Days 7 Nights Zanzibar Package","45461031905","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-11874485-1-1024x683.jpeg","Eight days gives you the complete Zanzibar experience: every one of the island''s signature tours, plus a full day just to relax at your beach resort. It is our most comprehensive Zanzibar package. Your hotel, airport transfers and all tours are arranged in advance, so you can enjoy a stress-free holiday from arrival to departure. Highlights Safari Blue: a fu","Safaris & Tours","1311","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-11874485-1-1024x683.jpeg&feedId=851&k=b81c3221b36aa9f1248514bb0dfe538c5601c414","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/days-7-nights-package/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-8-days-hike-machame-route-124668-45461031912','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031912&a=2893129&m=124668","8 Days Hike Machame Route","45461031912","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg","Nicknamed the \"Whiskey Route,\" the Machame Route is one of the most scenic and popular ways to climb Mount Kilimanjaro. It is more demanding than Marangu, but rewards you with constantly changing landscapes and some of the best views on the mountain. Over eight days you climb from lush rainforest through moorland and alpine desert to the summit of Uhuru Peak","Safaris & Tours","1939.2","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg&feedId=851&k=0dcaeb514f1ed3a2ecc4f499bedf07b32682d54a","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/8-days-hike-machame-route/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-8-days-hike-rongai-route-124668-45461031914','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031914&a=2893129&m=124668","8 Days Hike Rongai Route","45461031914","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg","The Rongai Route is the only trail that approaches Mount Kilimanjaro from the north, close to the Kenyan border. It is quieter than the southern routes, drier during the rainy seasons, and offers a gradual climb through wild, untouched landscapes. The route passes beneath the jagged spires of Mawenzi Peak and crosses the stark saddle between Mawenzi and Kibo","Safaris & Tours","2354.4","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg&feedId=851&k=0dcaeb514f1ed3a2ecc4f499bedf07b32682d54a","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/7-days-hike-rongai-route/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-9-day-majestic-kenya-safari-samburu-to-the-mara-124668-46566549325','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-samburu-elephants-1024x683.jpg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46566549325&a=2893129&m=124668","9-Day Majestic Kenya Safari: Samburu to the Mara","46566549325","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kenya-samburu-elephants-1024x683.jpg","Our most complete Kenya safari. Travel north to Samburu for rare species found nowhere else in Kenya''s south, then on to Ol Pejeta and the rhino sanctuary of Solio Ranch, Lake Nakuru and finally the Maasai Mara. Eight nights in five very different landscapes, ending at the Isebania border for an easy onward journey into Tanzania. Your safari at a glance Samb","Safaris & Tours","4242","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F10%2Fkenya-samburu-elephants-1024x683.jpg&feedId=851&k=3bbc8642066c2b29a30220104ea42eba689d3c6e","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/9-day-majestic-kenya-safari-samburu-to-the-mara/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-aml-travel-and-tours-9-days-hike-lemosho-route-124668-45461031911','AML Travel and Tours','travel','flights-car-rentals','https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45461031911&a=2893129&m=124668","9 Days Hike Lemosho Route","45461031911","https://amltravelandtours.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg","The Lemosho Route is widely regarded as the most beautiful and well-balanced way to climb Mount Kilimanjaro. Starting on the remote western side of the mountain, it crosses the vast Shira Plateau and circles beneath Kibo''s southern glaciers before reaching Uhuru Peak (5,895m), the highest point in Africa. With nine days on the itinerary, this is one of our m","Safaris & Tours","2348.4","AML Travel and Tours","124668","Holidays","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Aamltravelandtours.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F09%2Fpexels-photo-15993988-1024x707.jpeg&feedId=851&k=0dcaeb514f1ed3a2ecc4f499bedf07b32682d54a","GBP","","https://amltravelandtours.com/trip/9-days-hike-lemosho-route/","","","","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
