('awin-bookingradar-market-and-guacamole-cooking-class-in-tijuana-mexico-131140-46310228616','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','https://bookingradar.com/uploads/product_photo/2024-03-31/171186608353579200-xlarge.webp','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310228616&a=2893129&m=131140","Market and Guacamole Cooking Class in Tijuana Mexico","46310228616","https://bookingradar.com/uploads/product_photo/2024-03-31/171186608353579200-xlarge.webp","Guacamole from the nahuatl \"ahuacamolli\" it’s one of the most popular salsa or dips of mexico, but not everyone knows how to make it, in the tour we are going to take you to the market and choose your ingredients and show you the traditional way to do it. Guacamole from the nahuatl \"ahuacamolli\" it''s a combination of two words \"Ahucatl\" (Avocado) and \"Molli\"","Day tours","89.00","Booking Radar","131140","Tourist Attractions","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Abookingradar.com%2Fuploads%2Fproduct_photo%2F2024-03-31%2F171186608353579200-xlarge.webp&feedId=851&k=3ca0257f7dbd08eacfce489d2ee8f279ddcee902","USD","","https://bookingradar.com/tours/market-and-guacamole-cooking-class-in-tijuana-mexico?utm_source=awin&utm_medium=affiliate&utm_campaign=awin_program","en","2026-09-30 20:15:05","BookingRadar","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
('awin-bookingradar-marry-me-proposal-concept-in-goreme-131140-46310227681','BookingRadar','experiences','shows-attractions','https://bookingradar.com/uploads/product_photo/2024-01-05/170447222516571300-xlarge.webp','["https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46310227681&a=2893129&m=131140","Marry Me Proposal Concept in Göreme","46310227681","https://bookingradar.com/uploads/product_photo/2024-01-05/170447222516571300-xlarge.webp","Make this special day unforgettable with hot air balloons in the morning. A romantic marriage proposal in the wonderful landscape of Cappadocia will be unique.","Day tours","298.23","Booking Radar","131140","Tourist Attractions","https://images2.productserve.com/?w=200&h=200&bg=white&trim=5&t=letterbox&url=ssl%3Abookingradar.com%2Fuploads%2Fproduct_photo%2F2024-01-05%2F170447222516571300-xlarge.webp&feedId=851&k=4adcffafde94d38c670044be626831ab00045082","USD","","https://bookingradar.com/tours/marry-me-proposal-concept-in-goreme?utm_source=awin&utm_medium=affiliate&utm_campaign=awin_program","en","2026-10-01 02:45:07","BookingRadar","","","","","","","","","",""]'),
